  "readmeFile": "PackageReadme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0-alpha: built-in observability. OpenCIFS.Server and OpenCIFS.Client now emit metrics and traces through the base-class-library Meter and ActivitySource types (names OpenCIFS.Server and OpenCIFS.Client, listed in OpenCifsTelemetryNames), with no new package dependencies and near-zero cost until a host subscribes: server connections, per-stage packet latency including the server-wide lock wait, per-command latency and NT status, storage-backend latency, authentication, negotiation, session, tree, open, durable-handle, and async break/notification metrics with per-packet span trees; client operation, request, connect, queue, transport-failure, and byte metrics with nested spans. Also fixed CHANGE_NOTIFY file names using the host path separator instead of backslashes on Linux and macOS servers. See https://github.com/jchristn/OpenCIFS/blob/main/TELEMETRY.md and CHANGELOG.md.",
